---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/no_words.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/no_words.png" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>CartoTaco — The Tucson Taco Guide That Actually Knows Tucson</title>
    <meta name="description" content="No algorithms. No sponsored results. Just the spots worth knowing. A curated guide to Tucson's best small, local Mexican restaurants." />

    <!-- Open Graph -->
    <meta property="og:title" content="CartoTaco — The Tucson Taco Guide" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="No algorithms. No sponsored results. Just the spots worth knowing." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://cartotaco.com" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://cartotaco.com/og-image.png" />

    <!-- Twitter -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="CartoTaco — The Tucson Taco Guide" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="No algorithms. No sponsored results. Just the spots worth knowing." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://cartotaco.com/og-image.png" />

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@phosphor-icons/web@2.1.2/src/regular/style.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@phosphor-icons/web@2.1.2/src/bold/style.css" />

    <script is:inline>
      (function() {
        const root = document.documentElement;
        root.classList.add('no-transition');
        const theme = localStorage.getItem('theme');
        if (theme === 'dark' || (!theme && window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches)) {
          root.classList.add('dark');
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          requestAnimationFrame(() => {
            root.classList.remove('no-transition');
          });
        });
      })();
    </script>
  </head>

  <body class="bg-bg-primary text-text-primary font-body antialiased pb-20 sm:pb-0">

    <!-- ===== NAV ===== -->
    <nav id="nav" class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-bg-primary/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-border-strong">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/no_words.png" alt="CartoTaco logo" class="h-10 w-10" />
          <a href="#" class="font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">
            Carto<span class="text-accent">Taco</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <a href="https://carto-taco.vercel.app/census" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hidden md:inline-flex text-xs font-bold font-body uppercase tracking-widest text-text-secondary hover:text-accent">
            Taco Census
          </a>
          <a href="https://carto-taco.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hidden sm:inline-flex text-xs font-bold font-body uppercase tracking-widest text-accent hover:text-accent-hover border border-accent px-4 py-2 hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">
            Open the App
          </a>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <a
              href="https://instagram.com/carto_taco"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="CartoTaco on Instagram"
              class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-accent transition-colors text-xl"
              title="@carto_taco on Instagram"
            >
              <i class="ph ph-instagram-logo"></i>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://www.threads.com/@carto_taco"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="CartoTaco on Threads"
              title="@carto_taco on Threads"
              class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors text-xl"
            >
              <i class="ph ph-threads-logo"></i>
            </a>
          </div>
          <button
            id="theme-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-label="Toggle dark mode"
            class="p-2 text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary"
          >
            <i class="ph ph-sun hidden dark:block text-xl"></i>
            <i class="ph ph-moon block dark:hidden text-xl"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
    <section class="relative pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-44 md:pb-32 bg-bg-primary grain overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent mb-6">Tucson, AZ</p>
          <h1 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-extrabold leading-[0.95] uppercase text-text-primary">
            The taco guide<br/>
            that actually<br/>
            knows <span class="text-accent italic">Tucson.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-8 text-base sm:text-lg text-text-secondary max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
            No algorithms. No sponsored results.<br class="hidden sm:block" />
            Just the spots worth knowing.
          </p>
          <a id="open-now" href="https://carto-taco.vercel.app/census" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-3 group">
            <span class="live-dot shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span data-live-text class="text-xs font-body uppercase tracking-widest text-text-secondary group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">Live from the Taco Census &rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a
              href="https://carto-taco.vercel.app"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-accent text-white font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm hover:bg-accent-hover border-2 border-accent hover:border-accent-hover"
            >
              Open CartoTaco
              <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://carto-taco.vercel.app/census"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 text-accent font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm border-2 border-accent hover:bg-accent hover:text-white"
            >
              Explore the Taco Census
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Decorative slashes -->
      <div class="absolute top-20 right-8 md:right-16 text-accent/10 font-display text-[12rem] md:text-[20rem] font-extrabold leading-none select-none pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
        //
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== THE PROBLEM ===== -->
    <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-bg-secondary relative grain overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <p class="font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-text-tertiary mb-8">The problem</p>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-text-primary leading-relaxed">
            You've been there. You search for tacos, you get a list of the same five places with 4.2 stars and 800 reviews. Half of them are chains. The other half are fine. None of them are what you were looking for.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-text-primary leading-relaxed">
            The problem isn't that there's not enough information. It's that the wisdom of the masses isn't actually wise&nbsp;&mdash; it's just <span class="text-accent font-bold">loud.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <!-- Struck-through star rating -->
        <div class="mt-12 flex items-center gap-4 opacity-60 line-through decoration-accent decoration-[3px]">
          <div class="flex gap-1">
            {[1,2,3,4].map(() => (
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-text-tertiary" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" />
              </svg>
            ))}
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-text-tertiary opacity-30" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl text-text-tertiary">4.2 (847 reviews)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== THE PHILOSOPHY ===== -->
    <section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-bg-primary relative grain overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <p class="font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-text-tertiary mb-8">The idea</p>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-text-primary leading-relaxed">
            CartoTaco is built on a different idea: that one person who really knows a place is worth more than a thousand people who kinda liked it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-text-primary leading-relaxed">
            Every restaurant in here was chosen deliberately. You won't find everything&nbsp;&mdash; you'll find the right things. Spots that have been operating the same way for decades. Family places that don't have a website. Trucks that move. The taco that someone's abuela has been making since before you were born.
          </p>
        </div>
        <!-- Pull quote — big, rotated, raw -->
        <div class="mt-20 md:mt-24 -mx-2 sm:mx-0">
          <p class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-accent uppercase leading-[0.95] -rotate-1">
            This is a small<br/>list, on&nbsp;purpose.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== HOW IT WORKS ===== -->
    <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-bg-secondary relative grain overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <p class="font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-text-tertiary mb-4">The app</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase mb-16">
          How it works
        </h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-6">
          <div>
            <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-border-strong aspect-[4/3] mb-5 overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/shots/map-spots.jpg" width="2400" height="1857" alt="The CartoTaco map of central Tucson with search, Surprise Me, Trail and lens controls" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-left-top" />
            </div>
            <p class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-primary">Filters and search to find what you want</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-border-strong aspect-[4/3] mb-5 overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/shots/map-heat.jpg" width="1800" height="1742" loading="lazy" alt="Heat lens: spots coloured from pale to deep coral by salsa heat" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top" />
            </div>
            <p class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-primary">Small data, powerful viz</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-border-strong aspect-[4/3] mb-5 overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/shots/card.jpg" width="2000" height="1691" loading="lazy" alt="Spot card for Taqueria el Zarape: hours, address, vibe check, menu and protein radar charts" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top" />
            </div>
            <p class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-primary">Every spot, in detail</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature grid -->
        <div class="mt-20 pt-16 border-t border-border">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase mb-10">
            Plus a lot more
          </h3>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">

            <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-border-strong p-5 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <i class="ph ph-stack text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
              <h4 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Map Lenses</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">One tap switches the map between Spots, Heat, Salsas and Density. Where does Tucson burn hottest? Switch the lens.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-border-strong p-5 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <i class="ph ph-fire text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
              <h4 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Salsa Lineup + Heat Ladder</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Every salsa at every spot, rated, plus a heat score in city context: <em>“Hotter than 82% of Tucson spots.”</em></p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-border-strong p-5 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <i class="ph ph-fingerprint-simple text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
              <h4 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Vibe Fingerprints</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">The anti-review. Four quick votes (Heat Legit, Authentic, Value, Vibe) build a fingerprint for every spot.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-border-strong p-5 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <i class="ph ph-scales text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
              <h4 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Spot Comparison</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Pick 2&ndash;3 spots. The leader in each category is called out and their radar shapes overlay on one chart.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-border-strong p-5 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <i class="ph ph-trophy text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
              <h4 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Taco Summit</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Can’t agree where to eat? Share an anonymous ranked-choice voting link. Democracy decides.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-border-strong p-5 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <i class="ph ph-bicycle text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
              <h4 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Taco Trail</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">A multi-stop crawl routed for walking, biking or driving, with a shareable link.</p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== JUST SHIPPED ===== -->
    <section id="whats-new" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-bg-primary relative grain overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <p class="font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent mb-4">Just shipped</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase mb-4">
          What’s new on the map
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary mb-14 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          Every marker now tells you where a spot stands: open, closed, or still being scouted. The census only counts places that have been checked in person. Still zero star ratings.
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-14">
          <figure>
            <div class="border-2 border-border-strong overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/shots/closed-spot.jpg" width="2200" height="1684" loading="lazy" alt="North-central Tucson on CartoTaco: coral markers for vetted spots, a grey cross for Hot Dogs 501, which has closed, and grey question marks for spots still being scouted" class="w-full" />
            </div>
            <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs font-body uppercase tracking-widest text-text-tertiary">Vetted, closed (&times;) and scouted (?) on one map</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <div class="border-2 border-border-strong overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/shots/census-growth.jpg" width="1812" height="921" loading="lazy" alt="The map keeps growing: spots on the map from March to October, stepping up to 24 with one step down for a closure" class="w-full" />
            </div>
            <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs font-body uppercase tracking-widest text-text-tertiary">The census timeline, closures included</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary border-2 border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-x-circle text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
            <h3 class="font-display text-base font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Closed Spots Stay Marked</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">When a spot closes for good it becomes a grey &times; on the map with a note on its card. It drops out of stats, recommendations and trails, but it doesn’t vanish.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary border-2 border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-question text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
            <h3 class="font-display text-base font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Scouted, Not Yet Vetted</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Spots waiting for a visit show as grey question marks with a preliminary card. They aren’t counted anywhere until someone has eaten there.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary border-2 border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-chart-line-up text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
            <h3 class="font-display text-base font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">An Honest Growth Chart</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">The census timeline now counts openings <em>and</em> closures. A closure steps the line down from that day on instead of quietly rewriting the past.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary border-2 border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-chart-bar text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
            <h3 class="font-display text-base font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">The Tucson Taco Census</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">A live, shareable dashboard of the whole city’s taco scene: open right now, the protein leaderboard, tortilla politics, and when the city’s taco doors are open.</p>
            <a href="https://carto-taco.vercel.app/census" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold font-body uppercase tracking-widest text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">
              Explore the census <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary border-2 border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-circles-three text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
            <h3 class="font-display text-base font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Density Lens, Rebuilt</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">The Density lens is now a true heatmap of where Tucson’s spots cluster, instead of a dot per spot.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary border-2 border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-map-trifold text-accent text-3xl mb-3 block"></i>
            <h3 class="font-display text-base font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Down to Green Valley</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">The map now reaches south along I-19 to Green Valley.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== COMING SOON ===== -->
    <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-bg-secondary relative grain overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <p class="font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-text-tertiary mb-4">What's next</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase mb-4">
          On the roadmap
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary mb-14 max-w-xl">No launch dates. Just the direction.</p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-3xl">

          <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-pepper text-accent text-3xl mb-4 block"></i>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide">Salsa Atlas</h3>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent border border-accent px-2 py-0.5 shrink-0">Coming Soon</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Every salsa style in one place, grouped by family, colour, region or heat. Each gets its own page with ingredients, history and the spots that serve it, and the salsas you favorite tune your Taste Profile.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-chat-circle-dots text-accent text-3xl mb-4 block"></i>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide">AI Assistant</h3>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent border border-accent px-2 py-0.5 shrink-0">Coming Soon</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Ask the map in plain language: “open now, birria, handmade tortillas, near downtown.” Answers come only from the spots on the map, so it’s still a short list, just faster to search.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-map-pin text-accent text-3xl mb-4 block"></i>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide">Check-Ins</h3>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent border border-accent px-2 py-0.5 shrink-0">Coming Soon</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Geo-fenced check-ins with notes, aficionado badges, a public taco passport profile, and your recent visits visible right on spot cards.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-border-strong p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <i class="ph ph-users-three text-accent text-3xl mb-4 block"></i>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide">Meetups</h3>
